title: 'asset-conversion: treat frozen or blocked pools as unusable'
doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      A pool frozen or blocked for one of its assets could still be used. A frozen pool was
      one-way, and a blocked pool was still quoted although swaps through it failed.

      Such pools are now rejected in both directions with a new `PoolUnavailable` error. Pools
      that were drained to their minimum balance are not affected.
crates:
  - name: pallet-asset-conversion
    bump: major
    validate: false
  - name: pallet-asset-conversion-precompiles
    bump: patch
